    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "A stay at Kingsway Park Hotel at Park Avenue places you in the heart of London, within a 10-minute walk of Hyde Park and Kensington Gardens.  This guesthouse is 0.8 mi (1.2 km) from Marble Arch and 0.5 mi (0.9 km) from Paddington Central."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 19 guestrooms featuring refrigerators and flat-screen televisions. Complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected, and digital programming is available for your entertainment. Private bathrooms with bathtubs or showers feature complimentary toiletries and hair dryers. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Make use of convenient amenities such as complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and a fireplace in the lobby."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EHyde Park - 0.5 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Kensington Gardens - 0.5 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Paddington Central - 0.9 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Marble Arch - 1.2 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Park Lane - 1.3 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Baker Street - 1.4 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Queensway - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Selfridges - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Madame Tussauds Wax Museum - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Sherlock Holmes Museum - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Kensington High Street - 1.7 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Kensington Palace - 1.7 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Regent\u0027s Park - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Royal Albert Hall - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Marylebone High Street - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003ELondon City Airport (LCY) - 20.3 km / 12.6 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Heathrow Airport (LHR) - 27.9 km / 17.3 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Gatwick Airport (LGW) - 95.6 km / 59.4 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Luton Airport (LTN) - 50.7 km / 31.5 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Farnborough (FAB) - 62.7 km / 39 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Kingsway Park Hotel at Park Avenue is Heathrow Airport (LHR). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts major credit cards and cash\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher, a security system, and a first aid kit\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E   \u003Cli\u003EOne child 3 years old or younger stays free when occupying the parent or guardian\u0027s room, using existing bedding. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EContactless check-out is available.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "At Kingsway Park Hotel at Park Avenue, enjoy a satisfying meal at the restaurant. Wrap up your day with a drink at the bar/lounge."
    }
